{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張曦雯（Kelly）近期的工作排得密密麻麻，早前剛完成新劇《模範律師團》的拍攝後，便馬不停蹄地飛往馬來西亞工作。不過，她這次行程亦不忘寓工作於娛樂，順道好好放鬆一番。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Kelly日前在社交平台上載了多張大歎榴槤的照片。相中可見，她品嘗了多款不同品種的榴槤，表情一臉滿足，顯得相當開心。她接受傳媒訪問時更自認是「榴槤控」，並表示：「今次是第一次試齊這麼多品種，不過依然最愛貓山王。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4e8274e4-d002-4bd7-bce5-04ab78af06bd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026m6c4v9ZO5r1787906665.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4e8274e4-d002-4bd7-bce5-04ab78af06bd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e40422c6-90f2-44f2-9dba-8cad8bc06d3e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20265oG71nwu321787906665.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e40422c6-90f2-44f2-9dba-8cad8bc06d3e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了大飽口福，Kelly在當地亦深受群眾歡迎。從她分享的另一段活動短片中可見，她現身時被大批手持手機拍攝的粉絲重重包圍，足見其人氣極高。面對熱情的粉絲，Kelly全程保持甜美笑容，並親切地不停向大家揮手打招呼，盡顯親民魅力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c024c675-f8c8-4521-8249-e5298ef6428a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026pu0B44m5XK1787906665.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c024c675-f8c8-4521-8249-e5298ef6428a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T12:59:16.751352+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}